  "instance_name": "racially_motivated_violence",
  "label": "Violence directed against individuals or groups based on their race",
  "description": "Racially motivated violence refers to acts of violence that are directed against individuals or groups based on their race or ethnicity. The meme attempts to normalize or downplay this type of violence by implying that if the victims are not racially defined (e.g., zombies), then the act of killing them cannot be classified as homicide. This requires understanding of the concept of racially motivated violence and its moral/legal implications.",
